<title>UK: Turin appoints SBC Warburg as ratings adviser.</title>
<headline>Turin appoints SBC Warburg as ratings adviser.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Municipality of Turin (Comune di Torino) has appointed SBC Warburg as a credit ratings adviser, the bank said in a statement. SBC Warburg said Turin wanted to exploit opportunities offered by recent changes in legislation on capital raising by local municipalities in Italy, and a credit rating was being sought ahead of possible future transactions in the domestic and international capital markets.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
